### Third-Party Licenses, Credits & Compliance

This tool is inspired by and interacts with the following open source software:

- **musikcube**: BSD-3-Clause (<https://github.com/clangen/musikcube>) - Casey Langen & contributors (inspiration for terminal audio UX, split layout, and transport controls).
- **cava**: MIT License (<https://github.com/karlstav/cava>) - Karl Stavestrand & contributors (Console-based Audio Visualizer executed as a separate subprocess).
- **mpv**: GPL-2.0-or-later / LGPL-2.1-or-later (<https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv>) - The mpv project & contributors (media player daemon controlled via external JSON IPC over Unix domain socket).
- **textual**: MIT License (<https://github.com/Textualize/textual>) - Will McGugan & Textualize (modern terminal user interface framework).
- **rich**: MIT License (<https://github.com/Textualize/rich>) - Will McGugan & Textualize (terminal formatting, table rendering, and styled text).
- **yt-dlp**: The Unlicense (<https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp>) - The yt-dlp project team (audio stream and metadata extractor).
- **ffmpeg**: LGPL-2.1-or-later / GPL-2.0-or-later (<https://ffmpeg.org>) - Fabrice Bellard & the FFmpeg team (multimedia processing toolkit).
- **requests**: Apache License 2.0 (<https://github.com/psf/requests>) - Kenneth Reitz, PSF & contributors (HTTP client library).
